  "historyNote": "#4129, eff 9-10-86, EXPIRED: 9-10-92 New. #5621, eff 5-4-93; ss by #6992, INTERIM, eff 5-5-99, EXPIRED: 9-2-99 New. #7193, eff 1-26-00, EXPIRED: 1-26-08 New. #10816, eff 4-23-15",
